title 'Jordan P'


markdown <<MARKDOWN
#Jordan P. – User Profile

Oh no! It seems like everything is breaking for Jordan. Let's take a look to see if we can figure out what is going on.

**[Click here](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1GRBeFTM2ZnkZnTbZs6TPJsKO7Yu0ZBIbYnFX1nMiwwQ/edit?usp=sharing) if you would rather look at Jordan's audit logs as a document.**

**Name:** Jordan P.  
**Age:** 17  
**Location:** Sacramento, CA (lives with aunt and younger sibling)  
**School:** Attends from 8:30 AM–3:30 PM  
**Work:** Part-time at a smoothie shop (evenings)  
**Devices:** iPhone 14 (mobile), Chromebook (school-issued)  
**Tech Habits:** Logs in from home Wi-Fi or school; never uses public computers  
**Spending Habits:** Uses Apple Pay or debit card at local shops/food places; rarely shops online  
**Hobbies:** Fitness, drawing, volunteering at an animal shelter  
**Travel History:** Has never left California; doesn’t drive  
**Security Habits:** Uses Face ID and MFA; has used the same password for 5+ years  

---
